# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copied to .dev.vars (ignored by Git) on first `pnpm dev`.
# Production values: ./cli.sh set-agent-secret.

# Answers "echo: <your message>" instead of calling a model: what the e2e chat test expects, and free.
MOCK_MODEL=echo

# To talk to a real model locally with only a provider key: comment out MOCK_MODEL above, uncomment the
# two lines below and restart the stack. An empty AI_GATEWAY_URL calls the provider directly (no AI Gateway).
# AI_GATEWAY_URL=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Or go through a real AI Gateway: set AI_GATEWAY_URL to its full URL, plus CF_AIG_TOKEN when the gateway
# has authentication on (and a provider key unless the gateway stores one).
# CF_AIG_TOKEN=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
